# LLVM 后端递归实测：fact(5) = 120，无需标准输入。
0: (decl, u32, global, answer)
1: (param, 5, _, k)
2: (call, fact, _, answer)
3: (write:u32, answer, _, _)
4: (halt, _, _, _)
5: (label, _, _, fact)
6: (decl, u32, local, k)
7: (<=:u32, k, 1, is_base)
8: (jz, is_base, _, recurse)
9: (ret:u32, 1, _, _)
10: (label, _, _, recurse)
11: (-:u32, k, 1, next)
12: (param, next, _, k)
13: (call, fact, _, nested)
14: (*:u32, k, nested, value)
15: (ret:u32, value, _, _)
